Subject: Build the original placeholder provider with native compilers
Upstream-base: a8187061af65aa2022bfd8dc2e32163089ea0090

The Matching original NL/nlBind.cpp owns the actual placeholder0 definition.
Retain its declaration and initializer. The native compiler does not support
MWCC's small-data section attribute; keep that attribute for the Wii build.
No binding, callback, pool or game control flow changes.

diff --git a/src/NL/nlBind.cpp b/src/NL/nlBind.cpp
--- a/src/NL/nlBind.cpp
+++ b/src/NL/nlBind.cpp
@@ -1,3 +1,6 @@
 #include "NL/nlBind.h"
 
-__declspec(section ".sdata2") Placeholder<0> placeholder0 = { };
+#ifndef MSCHARGED_NATIVE
+__declspec(section ".sdata2")
+#endif
+Placeholder<0> placeholder0 = { };
